    "body": "`bitcoin-util getchainparams` prints the genesis hash byte-reversed compared to `getblockhash 0`:\r\n```\r\nbitcoin-util getchainparams | grep genesis\r\n```\r\n  \"genesis\": \"6fe28c0ab6f1b372c1a6a246ae63f74f931e8365e15a089c68d6190000000000\",\r\n```\r\nbitcoin-cli getblockhash 0\r\n```\r\n000000000019d6689c085ae165831e934ff763ae46a2a6c172b3f1b60a8ce26f\r\n\r\nUse `GetHex()` instead of `HexStr()`, consistent with `pow.limit` in the same output and with the RPCs.\r\n\r\nThe command is new in v32.0 (#35736), so I believe this should be backported before final release to avoid changing the output format afterwards.",
    "labels": [],
