      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "In theory, one could use something like this to make it more explicit:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/uint256.h b/src/uint256.h\r\nindex d722916..62bb228 100644\r\n--- a/src/uint256.h\r\n+++ b/src/uint256.h\r\n@@ -123,2 +123,6 @@ public:\r\n \r\n+// See GetHex(). If HexStr is intended, use HexStr(std::span{self}).\r\n+template <unsigned int BITS>\r\n+std::string HexStr(const base_blob<BITS>&) = delete;\r\n+\r\n template <unsigned int BITS>\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut it will be a bit verbose and I am not sure if it really helps.\r\n\r\n",
